test: gpfs filesystem

Ensures that fstab entries with external filesystems are validated based on their loaded module status.
-- input/etc/fstab --
gpfs_fs /gpfs gpfs defaults 0 0
gpfs_fs /gpfs gpfs defaults,atime,useNSDserver=always,nosyncnfs=1 0 0
gpfs_fs /gpfs gpfs fake_option 0 0
-- expected/validationerrors.txt --
Unknown gpfs mount option 'fake_option' on line 3
